    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūzunya kwa banhū ba ng'wa Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ū kūzunya kūlī kūbūsanya ū būng'hana bo mihayo īyo tūkwīyisagīlagwa, kūmana gete gīkī īlīho, nūūlū aho tūtaalī ū kwībona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bataale hū bakaanīlilwe mu mhayo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya tūmanile gīkī pyī ī shiseeng'wa shikabeejiwa mu nzīla ya mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu, hū kūhaya ī shikolo īsho shikūbonagwa shitafumile mu shikolo sha kūbonwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya ū Abeli akamfunīja shitambo shawiza ū Mulungu, kūtinda īsho akafunya Kaini, ū mu mhayo gwenūyo ūkaanīlwa kūbiza ntūngīlīja, nguno ū Mulungu ng'wenekīlī akashikaanīla ī shakwinha shakwe. Hūna lūūlū, ū mu mhayo gwenūyo ū Abeli ataalī akūlūngalūngaga, nūūlū īkī wamala kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya ū Enoka akīnjiwa atabītile mu kūcha. Atilongile nguno ū Mulungu akang'wīnja, īkī aho ataalī kwīnjiwa wakaanīlagwa gīkī walī anyegije ū Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ītī mu kūzunya, ītūdūlīkana ū kūnyeja ū Mulungu. Na lūūlū abo batogilwe kwiza kūlī we, shibigelile kūzunya gīkī alīho, na gīkī akabinhaga mheela abo bakankoobaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya ū Noa akabeeja ngalaba nguno akahūgūlwa na Mulungu, nūūlū īkī ī mihayo īyo akawīlwa yalī mumbisila; wīpīja ī kaya yakwe nguno walī na logohano. Ūbiza wingīla mu būtūngīlīja kūlwa kūzunya, alīyo ī sī ūyenheleja kūgwisījiwa nsango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya ū Abulahamu aho wawīlwa kūja kwipandī īlo alanukūle kūbiza wingīji bokwe, akazunya ūja nūūlū īkī walī atamanile ūko wajaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya aho alī ū mu sī ya kwisagījiwa yenīyo walī gītī nshimīzi; wikalaga mu maheema, pye nū Isaka nū Yakobo, abo nabo baalī bingīji ū mu wisagījiwa wenūbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno walī agwisagīlilwe ū nzengo ūyo gūlī na misingi; ūyo meeja na nzengi wago alī Mulungu ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya nū Saala nang'hwe īkī akansanya ūyo akabisagījaga, akapandīka būdūla bo kūbūūcha nda, nūūlū īkī a makanza gakwe gaalī gamala kūbīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū kūfuma ū mulī munhū ūmò ng'wenūyo, ūyo nīyo walī sumva na mfu, wilonga būhī na būhī bo banhū, ū wingī wabo gītī sonda ja ng'wigūlū, nūūlū gītī maseni ga ha nyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a bose benaba bakachīla mu kūzunya, ī shikolo īsho baalī bisagījiwa bashiloleelaga bū kūle būyūshiyegela. Alīyo būūcha bataalī ū kūshanukūla, būbiza bakaanīji gīkī baalī bageni na bashimīzi ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakahayaga mihayo īlī gīko, bakoolechaga hape gīkī balī bachooji ba sī yabo ya wikomangīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū ni bikale bakūgwiganikaga ū nzengo ūyo baalī bafuma, nose ni bapandīke ng'wanya gwa kūshoka ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bakasangwa balī na ng'hūmbū ja kūbiza mu nzengo gwawiza kūtinda, h'ū ng'wigūlū; h'ī nguno yene ū Mulungu atī na minala ū kwitanwa gīkī alī Mulungu wabo, nguno wamala kūbalonja longeja nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya, ū Abulahamu akamfunya ū Isaka aho wageng'wa; ū wei ūyo walī winhwa wisagījiwa, ūzunya kūmfunya ū ng'wana wakwe ūyo walī ūmò dūhū ng'wenūyo, gīkī abize shitambo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūūlū īkī walī wawīlwa gīkī, “Ū būbyīle wako būkwitanīlwa mulī Isaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabala gīkī ū Mulungu adūgije kunhimbula kūfuma mu bafu; na ng'hana ūbiza gītī wang'wanukūla kūfuma mu bafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya, ū Isaka nang'hwe ūbafuuha a ba Yakobo nū Esau, akūbalombelaga lubango kūlwa mihayo ya shikū ja kū būtongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya, ū Yakobo aho wegeela kūcha akamfuuha būlī ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yosefu, kūnū alīlamya widimīlījaga ha nang'ha gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya, ū Yosefu aho wegeela kūcha akabizūkīja a Baisilaeli ī mihayo ya kwīnga mu Misili, ūbalagīla nī mihayo ya maguha gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya, a babyaji ba ng'wa Musa aho wabyalwa, bakamisa ikanza lya myeji idatū, nguno bakamona gīkī walī ng'wana wawiza; būleka ū kūshogoha ī shilagīlo sha ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya, ū Musa aho wakūla ūlema ū kwitanwa gīkī ng'witūnja wa nshīke wa ng'wa Falao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbona īlī hambū hambū kūluhiwa hamò na banhū ba ng'wa Mulungu, kūtinda kūyegela mu shibi ng'wikanza iguhī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno akabona gīkī, ū būsondagūlwa bo ng'wa Kilisito būlī sabo nhaale kūtinda būsabi wa mu Misili, īkī walī waloleela mheela ū kū būtongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akīnga ī Misili kūlwa kūzunya, ūleka ū kūbogoha ū būpelanu wa ntemi; wiyūmīlīja nguno walī wamona ūyo atabonagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya, akabeeja pasaka ūseeseebela na mininga, gīkī ū nyagaja wa babyalwa ba kwandya atizūbakuumya a babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya bakabīta ū mu Nyanza ī Yaza balīshimīza, gītī balī ha sī nyūmu; aho bihamba a Bamisili yūbamila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya, ī ndugu ja Yeliko bakajipīndīīla ikanza lya shikū mpungatī, jūgwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūzunya, ū malahya ū Lahabu atayagalile hamò nabo a bashitiigwa, nguno akabanukūla mu mhola a badati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī nahaye mhayo kī hangī? Nguno lītūniigelaga ī likanza lya kūbahaya banhū gītī: Gidioni, Balaka, Samusoni, Yefuta, Daūdi, Sang'weli; pye na a bahangi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abo kūlwa kūzunya baalī bapyeni, būyūpyena mabūtemi na kūbeeja ya būtūngīlīja, banukūla īyo baalī bisagījiwa. Hangī būbiza na būdūla bo kūyūkundīkīja na milomo ya shimba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kūjimya būsebu wa moto; būyūpūlūgūka na kūbūlagwa bo malūshū. Bangī būyūguzuhiwa kūfuma mu būgokolo, bapandīka būdūla bo kūheeba mabita ga banishi mu būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bakīma babīta kwanukūla bafu babo, abo bakayūjūūchiwa. Bangī batūlagwa kūshisha kūbūlagwa, alīyo ū gwa kūlekejiwa baalī bagūlemile, nguno baalī bamanile gīkī bakwanukūla būjūūko būsoga kūtinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangī bagwaga mu būgeng'wa būtaale no bo kwineenelegejiwa na kūtūlwa, hamò na kūyūtungwa baponyiwa mu jeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangī bapondagwa mawe, na bangī bakeleshiagwa na misumeno; bingī baacha bo līlūshū. Bangī ū mu kūpeela kwabo bajaga bakūyūngaga hose hose, bazwalile ndīlī ja ng'holo na ja mbūli. Baalī mu būgayiwa na būluhiwa būtaale no; īyo bīītīlagwa yalī yabūbi no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū sī yababonaga gīkī batī na ngofyoolo nūūlū hado; bajaga bakūyūngaga mu matogolo, na kwisweng'ha mu mahalo ga mu ngūlū na mu myobo ya ha sī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a benaba bakaanīlilwe chiza ū mu kūzunya kwabo, alīyo batawanukūlile ū wisagījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Mulungu walī atūbīkīlile a bise mhayo gwawiza no; ībize gīkī ū būshikanyiwa wabo būjīlanīje nū wise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
